  "title": {
    "zh": "等高线",
    "en": "Contour Lines"
  },
  "desc": {
    "zh": "地图上那些一圈圈的曲线，是把山体按相同高度一层层切开、再从正上方看下去的样子——圈越密的地方越陡。",
    "en": "The rings on a map come from slicing a hill at equal heights and looking straight down: where the rings crowd together, the ground is steep."
  },
